WEBVTT

00:00:42.850 --> 00:00:44.940
Damned brat!

00:00:50.690 --> 00:00:52.650
Y-You...

00:00:53.030 --> 00:00:55.070
I'm telling Mommy!

00:00:55.070 --> 00:00:56.530
I'll remember this, jerk!

00:00:56.990 --> 00:00:58.320
What the heck?

00:00:59.830 --> 00:01:01.870
Mister, are you okay?

00:01:01.870 --> 00:01:03.040
Thank you.

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:05.210
You saved me.

00:01:05.830 --> 00:01:09.090
I must do something to thank you.

00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:12.760
The last one...

00:01:16.090 --> 00:01:17.970
It may surprise you,

00:01:17.970 --> 00:01:21.180
but this is a key that will lead 
you to the truth of this world.

00:01:32.030 --> 00:01:35.780
Ow! This really hurts, dude!

00:01:35.780 --> 00:01:37.450
It's like an electric shock!

00:01:40.070 --> 00:01:43.290
W-Wait, what is this? A tattoo?

00:01:43.290 --> 00:01:47.460
I think I now see why they say 
"curiosity killed the cat."

00:01:47.460 --> 00:01:48.290
Huh?

00:01:49.540 --> 00:01:53.380
<i>Looking back now, that 
was the start of it all.</i>

00:01:54.550 --> 00:01:59.510
<i>That was the moment I first 
set foot in the underworld.</i>

00:03:30.940 --> 00:03:34.020
Tattoo

00:03:36.770 --> 00:03:38.690
Come on, hurry up!

00:03:39.190 --> 00:03:41.700
Crap!

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:46.160
Move! Move! Move!

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:02.260
S-Sorry about that!

00:04:02.680 --> 00:04:04.800
It's hard to avoid striking 
out when someone is barreling

00:04:04.800 --> 00:04:06.390
toward me, you know?

00:04:06.390 --> 00:04:07.680
Ow...

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:09.720
No, I couldn't react in time.

00:04:09.720 --> 00:04:11.730
Uh, are you okay?

00:04:13.690 --> 00:04:14.810
Ow!

00:04:14.810 --> 00:04:16.980
What was that?

00:04:30.040 --> 00:04:31.540
Be more careful.

00:04:31.540 --> 00:04:33.120
Ah, wait...

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:36.750
Seigi! What are you doing?

00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:39.460
We seriously don't have time for this!

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:45.180
And the nation that has grown 
even more rapidly than Japan

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:48.260
is the Kingdom of Selinistan 
in southern Asia.

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:52.640
Kingdom of Selinistan
Awesome

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:52.640
The
queen's
cute

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:52.640
Saudi
Arabia

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:52.640
Euler's formula
Beautiful!!

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:52.640
Wanna go here

00:04:48.510 --> 00:04:53.060
It leads the world in various areas 
of technological development,

00:04:53.060 --> 00:04:57.730
and boasts the second highest GDP 
in the world, next to America's.

00:04:57.730 --> 00:04:59.610
It's become an economic power.

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:03.530
I'm sure you know this if you watch the news,

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:07.570
but relations between this kingdom and 
America have worsened in recent years.

00:05:07.990 --> 00:05:11.240
If war breaks out, then Japan, 
as their ally, will also...

00:05:16.120 --> 00:05:18.040
What are you doing?

00:05:18.420 --> 00:05:20.460
This thing won't come off.

00:05:20.460 --> 00:05:22.670
What's that? A fake tattoo?

00:05:22.670 --> 00:05:24.010
No idea.

00:05:24.010 --> 00:05:27.130
I helped a guy who was being hassled 
by punks, and he gave it to me.

00:05:27.130 --> 00:05:29.260
Helping people again?

00:05:29.260 --> 00:05:32.310
You've got guts, or maybe 
you're just too nice.

00:05:32.770 --> 00:05:36.730
My grandpa's trained me in the martial arts.

00:05:38.150 --> 00:05:42.650
You know, there's a rumor going around 
among military otaku online...

00:05:43.820 --> 00:05:46.610
They say America's been developing some

00:05:46.610 --> 00:05:49.620
crazy secret weapon to 
use against that kingdom.

00:05:49.620 --> 00:05:50.620
America?

00:05:50.990 --> 00:05:54.870
Yeah. I think it was called 
a "sealing combat device."

00:05:54.870 --> 00:05:57.670
They say someone took it out of America,

00:05:57.670 --> 00:06:00.460
and now it's on the move in 
the Japanese underground.

00:06:00.460 --> 00:06:01.340
So what?

00:06:01.710 --> 00:06:04.800
The secret weapon apparently 
resembles a tattoo!

00:06:05.130 --> 00:06:06.050
Weapon?

00:06:06.050 --> 00:06:07.800
That doesn't seem very secret at all.

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:09.260
That's so dumb.

00:06:09.590 --> 00:06:12.970
Anyway, Seigi, will you come 
shopping with me on the way home?

00:06:13.220 --> 00:06:15.680
What? I have to be at the dojo today.

00:06:15.680 --> 00:06:18.480
Whose fault do you think 
it is that we were late?

00:06:18.480 --> 00:06:20.860
You could've just gone on ahead, Touko.

00:06:20.860 --> 00:06:26.530
Y-Your mom asked me to keep an eye on you!

00:06:26.780 --> 00:06:27.900
Is she his wife?

00:06:27.900 --> 00:06:28.780
Totally his wife.

00:06:28.780 --> 00:06:31.490
H-Hey! No one asked for your stupid comments!

00:06:31.740 --> 00:06:34.370
After school, Seigi! Don't forget!

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:35.950
All right, all right.

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:42.000
<i>Seriously, what is this thing?</i>

00:06:45.380 --> 00:06:48.380
Seigi, what do you want for dinner tonight?

00:06:48.380 --> 00:06:50.220
I'm cooking,

00:06:50.550 --> 00:06:51.840
so I'll make whatever you like.

00:06:51.840 --> 00:06:53.470
Anything's fine.

00:06:53.800 --> 00:06:55.180
You always do so much for me.

00:06:55.180 --> 00:06:56.600
I can't be picky.

00:06:56.600 --> 00:06:59.350
I'm the one who said I'd cook for you.

00:06:59.310 --> 00:07:06.030
Supermarket

00:06:59.350 --> 00:07:01.650
Don't be shy. Ask for whatever you want.

00:07:03.150 --> 00:07:05.780
Okay, then I want European-style 
American Indian curry udon.

00:07:06.360 --> 00:07:10.490
E-European-style American Indian curry udon?

00:07:10.820 --> 00:07:12.490
Does that exist?

00:07:12.490 --> 00:07:14.370
If it doesn't, anything's fine.

00:07:14.580 --> 00:07:15.620
Hang on!

00:07:15.620 --> 00:07:16.540
It's okay!

00:07:16.540 --> 00:07:17.830
I'll make it!

00:07:18.750 --> 00:07:20.710
I'd better call Grandpa.

00:07:24.250 --> 00:07:25.420
Hi.

00:07:26.840 --> 00:07:28.260
It's been half a day.

00:07:29.590 --> 00:07:31.630
I'm really sorry about this morning.

00:07:32.130 --> 00:07:34.180
Is your forehead okay?

00:07:34.800 --> 00:07:36.140
That girl from...

00:07:37.470 --> 00:07:38.220
Huh?

00:07:39.180 --> 00:07:40.850
Flee

00:07:41.100 --> 00:07:42.100
She stole my phone?!

00:07:42.350 --> 00:07:43.730
H-Hold it!

00:07:43.730 --> 00:07:44.230
Wait!

00:07:44.230 --> 00:07:45.270
Wait!

00:07:45.520 --> 00:07:47.610
Seigi, an employee taught me

00:07:47.610 --> 00:07:52.610
how to make American European 
Indian curry, Jamaican style.

00:07:52.820 --> 00:07:54.070
Look!

00:07:54.070 --> 00:07:55.530
I've got all the ingredients!

00:07:55.530 --> 00:07:57.080
You carry the—

00:07:57.080 --> 00:07:57.870
Huh?

00:08:00.200 --> 00:08:02.000
He's not even here!

00:08:20.850 --> 00:08:21.850
Where are you?!

00:08:21.850 --> 00:08:22.890
Get out here!

00:08:22.890 --> 00:08:23.980
Show yourself!

00:08:24.810 --> 00:08:26.270
Akatsuka "Justice."

00:08:27.860 --> 00:08:30.280
Third-year at Harumi Private Middle School.

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:31.360
Huh...

00:08:31.360 --> 00:08:32.740
That's an unusual name.

00:08:33.150 --> 00:08:36.450
They call those "DQN names" in Japan, right?

00:08:36.740 --> 00:08:39.160
M-My dad picked my name!

00:08:39.160 --> 00:08:40.700
I was their first kid,

00:08:40.700 --> 00:08:43.410
so my parents had some weird ideas!

00:08:43.410 --> 00:08:45.540
And don't look at my phone!

00:08:45.540 --> 00:08:46.210
Give it back!

00:08:50.630 --> 00:08:52.550
There's something I want to ask you.

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:55.050
Where did you get that tattoo?

00:08:55.340 --> 00:08:56.140
Huh?

00:08:56.510 --> 00:08:57.680
Tattoo?

00:09:01.850 --> 00:09:03.180
What are you doing?!

00:09:04.520 --> 00:09:07.190
That's a top secret American creation.

00:09:07.190 --> 00:09:08.690
I'll need you to give it back.

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:10.020
American?

00:09:10.020 --> 00:09:10.860
Secret?

00:09:10.860 --> 00:09:12.190
What are you talking about?!

00:09:24.460 --> 00:09:25.580
Crap!

00:09:26.620 --> 00:09:27.670
Oh?

00:09:33.170 --> 00:09:34.670
If that's how you want it...

00:09:35.510 --> 00:09:37.890
I won't hold back, either!

00:09:46.770 --> 00:09:48.650
You're not half bad.

00:10:07.160 --> 00:10:08.000
<i>Damn...</i>

00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:11.210
<i>I'm gonna be killed.</i>

00:10:26.480 --> 00:10:27.690
Sorry!

00:10:28.020 --> 00:10:29.770
I went a little too far!

00:10:30.150 --> 00:10:32.480
It's hard for me to hold back just enough.

00:10:34.020 --> 00:10:36.110
You surprised me, though.

00:10:36.110 --> 00:10:37.860
You held out that long against me

00:10:37.860 --> 00:10:39.950
without using your tattoo's power.

00:10:40.410 --> 00:10:42.620
Are you really in middle school?

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:47.960
You keep talking about a tattoo...

00:10:48.120 --> 00:10:49.960
What the hell does that mean?

00:10:49.960 --> 00:10:51.500
Then you attack me out of nowhere!

00:10:51.500 --> 00:10:52.840
I don't get you!

00:10:52.840 --> 00:10:55.000
Who the hell are you?!

00:10:57.130 --> 00:10:59.010
I thought it seemed strange.

00:10:59.010 --> 00:11:02.090
That's not something a child like you 
should be able to get your hands on.

00:11:02.090 --> 00:11:03.640
A child?

00:11:03.640 --> 00:11:05.390
You're just a kid, too!

00:11:07.060 --> 00:11:08.430
I just look like one.

00:11:08.930 --> 00:11:11.270
I'm actually much older than you.

00:11:11.980 --> 00:11:13.190
This is a tattoo.

00:11:17.320 --> 00:11:19.530
It's activated through the charging

00:11:19.950 --> 00:11:22.740
of its user's own unique "trigger."

00:11:22.990 --> 00:11:25.410
They're super-scientific weapons 
that drastically enhance

00:11:25.410 --> 00:11:28.410
the physical abilities of their 
users, known as the "Sealed,"

00:11:28.870 --> 00:11:32.830
allowing them to bring forth

00:11:33.290 --> 00:11:34.920
supernatural phenomena.

00:11:39.050 --> 00:11:42.130
This chalk is my trigger.

00:11:42.130 --> 00:11:43.430
When I do this...

00:11:47.010 --> 00:11:47.970
It activates.

00:11:50.600 --> 00:11:53.940
This is an air bomb made of 
high-density atmospheric air.

00:11:55.310 --> 00:11:56.320
This is...

00:12:00.990 --> 00:12:02.070
my tattoo's power.

00:12:07.450 --> 00:12:09.410
Akatsuka Dojo

00:12:10.410 --> 00:12:11.660
Not good enough!

00:12:12.080 --> 00:12:14.880
You challenged a thief and lost?

00:12:15.460 --> 00:12:17.750
What have you learned in all this time?

00:12:17.960 --> 00:12:20.760
Do you know why your father died?

00:12:21.340 --> 00:12:23.720
Because he wasn't strong enough!

00:12:24.130 --> 00:12:25.180
He wanted to protect the weak,

00:12:25.180 --> 00:12:27.350
but he wasn't even strong!

00:12:32.980 --> 00:12:36.150
If you intend to follow the same path he did,

00:12:36.150 --> 00:12:38.110
you need to get stronger.

00:12:38.480 --> 00:12:41.570
Justice without strength is not justice.

00:12:52.750 --> 00:12:53.910
Are you upset?

00:12:54.420 --> 00:12:56.830
Looking downward all the time won't help.

00:12:57.290 --> 00:12:59.420
When you're upset, look forward.

00:12:59.710 --> 00:13:00.550
Forward?

00:13:00.550 --> 00:13:01.300
Right.

00:13:01.760 --> 00:13:05.340
If there's something you want, 
stretch out your hand.

00:13:05.340 --> 00:13:07.010
Stretch out?

00:13:07.010 --> 00:13:09.260
And if you still can't reach it...

00:13:14.810 --> 00:13:16.190
Damn it.

00:13:17.900 --> 00:13:19.770
That's it for announcements.

00:13:19.770 --> 00:13:21.190
Any questions?

00:13:22.610 --> 00:13:24.400
Akatsuka, what happened to your face?

00:13:24.780 --> 00:13:25.860
Had a fight?

00:13:25.860 --> 00:13:26.990
At the dojo.

00:13:28.070 --> 00:13:30.030
Well, try not to go overboard.

00:13:36.120 --> 00:13:38.380
You told him too many secrets, Lieutenant!

00:13:38.380 --> 00:13:41.380
Café

00:13:38.630 --> 00:13:41.380
Tom, don't call me "Lieutenant" in public.

00:13:41.670 --> 00:13:43.760
How many times must I tell you?

00:13:43.760 --> 00:13:45.720
Oh, I'm sorry... Izzy.

00:13:46.300 --> 00:13:47.800
But more importantly,

00:13:47.800 --> 00:13:50.930
why didn't you apprehend him, Lieutenant?

00:13:51.220 --> 00:13:52.600
Our mission is to recover

00:13:52.600 --> 00:13:55.600
the tattoos that have spread outside America.

00:13:55.600 --> 00:13:58.520
I realize he is an irregular target,

00:13:58.520 --> 00:14:00.900
but that doesn't mean we can just let him go.

00:14:01.360 --> 00:14:03.940
The bug isn't picking up very well...

00:14:01.360 --> 00:14:04.230
If he were to leak out any 
information, we'll be...

00:14:04.230 --> 00:14:05.990
Are you even listening?!

00:14:06.650 --> 00:14:07.700
Yes, I'm listening!

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:08.700
Keep it down!

00:14:08.860 --> 00:14:10.660
Bug

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:13.160
Here's your hot milk and coffee.

00:14:14.120 --> 00:14:15.660
I'm sorry...

00:14:20.250 --> 00:14:23.590
But I want you to leave that boy to me.

00:14:23.590 --> 00:14:24.170
But...

00:14:37.180 --> 00:14:39.230
<i>Ah, this is heaven...</i>

00:14:39.440 --> 00:14:40.480
What?

00:14:40.480 --> 00:14:41.940
You know I have trouble with hot foods.

00:14:49.570 --> 00:14:51.410
Nothing's happening.

00:15:03.000 --> 00:15:04.460
Day 1

00:15:08.970 --> 00:15:10.180
Day 2

00:15:12.680 --> 00:15:13.890
Day 3

00:15:25.440 --> 00:15:26.400
Touko?

00:15:26.400 --> 00:15:28.900
What is with that stalker chick?!

00:15:28.900 --> 00:15:30.570
I'm gonna go tell her off!

00:15:30.570 --> 00:15:32.320
She's someone I know!

00:15:32.950 --> 00:15:33.780
Huh?

00:15:33.780 --> 00:15:35.330
Some stuff happened.

00:15:35.660 --> 00:15:36.910
I'll go talk to her.

00:15:36.910 --> 00:15:38.160
You go on ahead.

00:15:39.330 --> 00:15:42.210
Try not to let any weird 
girls get hold of you,

00:15:42.210 --> 00:15:43.460
Mr. Ally of Justice.

00:15:47.300 --> 00:15:47.920
Now, then...

00:15:50.590 --> 00:15:51.470
Hey.

00:15:53.390 --> 00:15:56.260
W-Well, what a coincidence.

00:15:56.430 --> 00:15:57.760
How have you been?

00:15:58.100 --> 00:16:00.810
If you're gonna tail me, do it right.

00:16:00.810 --> 00:16:02.390
It's impossible to miss you.

00:16:02.390 --> 00:16:05.060
Gloom

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:05.060
<i>Huh?</i>

00:16:05.610 --> 00:16:07.020
<i>She thought I didn't know?!</i>

00:16:08.530 --> 00:16:11.860
I-It looks like you haven't told 
anyone what I told you the other day.

00:16:11.860 --> 00:16:12.650
That's good.

00:16:12.650 --> 00:16:13.990
I commend you.

00:16:13.990 --> 00:16:15.700
Did I scare you that much?

00:16:20.200 --> 00:16:24.080
I always thought I was fairly 
strong, and I was proud of that.

00:16:24.540 --> 00:16:25.750
Then you...

00:16:25.960 --> 00:16:28.130
You really hate losing, huh?

00:16:28.130 --> 00:16:30.050
And you're so honest.

00:16:31.260 --> 00:16:33.630
You are indeed strong.

00:16:33.630 --> 00:16:35.840
More than strong enough for your age.

00:16:38.100 --> 00:16:40.350
How do you use the tattoo?

00:16:40.850 --> 00:16:43.520
I tried it with chalk like you did,

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:45.100
but it never worked.

00:16:45.350 --> 00:16:47.440
The trigger differs depending on the tattoo.

00:16:47.810 --> 00:16:49.860
My trigger is chalk,

00:16:49.860 --> 00:16:52.900
but that doesn't mean yours will be chalk.

00:16:53.150 --> 00:16:54.280
Oh...

00:16:54.860 --> 00:16:56.910
You want the power of the tattoo that badly?

00:16:57.530 --> 00:16:58.160
Yeah.

00:17:07.130 --> 00:17:08.790
Outta my way, brat!

00:17:09.090 --> 00:17:11.210
I'm not going anywhere!

00:17:16.760 --> 00:17:19.470
<i>I'm really not weak, right?</i>

00:17:19.760 --> 00:17:22.060
Wow, very good!

00:17:22.060 --> 00:17:24.270
Now if you take him to the 
police, you'll be rewarded.

00:17:25.060 --> 00:17:26.770
Are you okay?

00:17:26.770 --> 00:17:28.270
What... Tom?!

00:17:28.520 --> 00:17:29.440
Oh!

00:17:29.440 --> 00:17:29.980
Lieutenant!

00:17:30.320 --> 00:17:32.440
What are you doing?

00:17:32.440 --> 00:17:34.490
I'm sorry!

00:17:34.490 --> 00:17:35.700
I was trying to capture

00:17:35.700 --> 00:17:38.410
the other target that we spoke of before...

00:17:38.410 --> 00:17:40.490
You're such a klutz.

00:17:40.490 --> 00:17:41.540
Here, your nose is bl—

00:17:49.790 --> 00:17:51.920
No more games!

00:17:51.920 --> 00:17:54.720
Don't get ahead of yourself, brat!

00:17:55.420 --> 00:17:56.760
Is that a tattoo?

00:17:57.130 --> 00:17:59.140
Tom, take the boy.

00:17:59.140 --> 00:18:00.680
I'll clean up here.

00:18:01.220 --> 00:18:02.060
I'll take him.

00:18:06.230 --> 00:18:07.980
He's a Sealed.

00:18:07.980 --> 00:18:12.190
He's obtained superhuman strength 
by activating his tattoo.

00:18:12.770 --> 00:18:15.820
No unarmed flesh-and-blood 
human could defeat him.

00:18:16.820 --> 00:18:18.320
That doesn't mean a thing.

00:18:20.280 --> 00:18:22.490
I haven't lost yet.

00:18:27.790 --> 00:18:28.670
You won't stop him?

00:18:29.120 --> 00:18:30.330
Let him do as he pleases.

00:18:32.090 --> 00:18:32.840
And?

00:18:32.840 --> 00:18:34.840
Who is that musclebrained idiot?

00:18:36.130 --> 00:18:38.470
His name is Theodore Wilson.

00:18:38.470 --> 00:18:41.220
He's a member of the mafia 
based in Los Angeles.

00:18:41.930 --> 00:18:43.850
He apparently came to 
Japan to buy the tattoos,

00:18:43.850 --> 00:18:46.890
scattered around here, 
from the Japanese yakuza.

00:18:46.890 --> 00:18:49.980
He's well known among his peers for 
his large stature and strength,

00:18:49.980 --> 00:18:52.190
and he's been nicknamed "Bear Teddy."

00:18:52.190 --> 00:18:54.440
He truly is like a bear.

00:18:57.070 --> 00:18:59.110
What's with that cute nickname?!

00:18:59.110 --> 00:19:01.700
His buddies have no naming sense at all!

00:19:01.700 --> 00:19:03.240
<i>I'm fighting with all I've got here!</i>

00:19:03.240 --> 00:19:05.290
<i>Why is she laughing?!</i>

00:19:07.410 --> 00:19:09.210
Quit jumping around!

00:19:14.540 --> 00:19:17.630
Still, he does have 
incredible brute strength.

00:19:17.630 --> 00:19:20.130
Even if the tattoo is enhancing his power.

00:19:20.130 --> 00:19:22.340
Once a Sealed has activated his tattoo,

00:19:22.340 --> 00:19:24.550
all of his specs as a living 
being are ramped up.

00:19:25.100 --> 00:19:27.640
So to fight a Sealed,

00:19:27.640 --> 00:19:29.730
you need to be a Sealed, too.

00:19:30.100 --> 00:19:31.100
All right...

00:19:31.100 --> 00:19:33.230
I'll give you just one hint on how to win.

00:19:33.440 --> 00:19:34.360
A hint?

00:19:34.360 --> 00:19:37.690
He's a newbie who's had his 
tattoo for less than a month.

00:19:38.070 --> 00:19:40.780
He hasn't mastered all of its specs yet.

00:19:41.490 --> 00:19:43.990
He's like a rookie driving an F1 machine.

00:19:45.990 --> 00:19:47.080
<i>I get it.</i>

00:19:47.080 --> 00:19:49.040
<i>He is stronger and faster than before,</i>

00:19:49.660 --> 00:19:52.170
<i>but all of his attacks swing 
too wide, leaving him open!</i>

00:19:53.170 --> 00:19:56.170
<i>I haven't taken a single solid hit yet.</i>

00:20:01.510 --> 00:20:05.180
<i>His weapon is his tank-like 
destructive force.</i>

00:20:05.180 --> 00:20:08.430
<i>So if I just use that force against him...</i>

00:20:12.100 --> 00:20:12.850
<i>How's that?!</i>

00:20:17.150 --> 00:20:18.780
Now you've done it.

00:20:24.240 --> 00:20:26.240
I'm done running away.

00:20:26.580 --> 00:20:29.830
It's ridiculous to come all the 
way to Japan just to sneak around.

00:20:30.370 --> 00:20:33.960
You guys are with the US Army 
Tattoo Retrieval Unit, right?

00:20:34.290 --> 00:20:38.710
I'll take your tattoos back 
home to my boss as souvenirs.

00:20:38.920 --> 00:20:41.090
<i>He's lost way too much blood.</i>

00:20:41.090 --> 00:20:43.050
And first...

00:20:44.470 --> 00:20:45.760
I'll crush him.

00:20:46.090 --> 00:20:47.220
<i>I'm gonna be killed.</i>

00:20:47.680 --> 00:20:48.720
<i>Why?</i>

00:20:48.720 --> 00:20:49.600
<i>Why is this happening?</i>

00:20:49.850 --> 00:20:50.390
Lieutenant!

00:20:50.390 --> 00:20:51.220
<i>When did I get myself</i>

00:20:51.220 --> 00:20:54.310
<i>into a world where people 
kill and get killed?</i>

00:20:56.350 --> 00:20:57.270
<i>No...</i>

00:20:57.690 --> 00:20:58.650
<i>I don't want to die!</i>

00:20:59.230 --> 00:21:00.610
<i>I don't want to lose!</i>

00:21:00.610 --> 00:21:03.490
<i>I don't want it to end here!</i>

00:21:04.110 --> 00:21:06.410
If there's something you want, 
stretch out your hand.

00:21:09.120 --> 00:21:10.740
And if you still can't reach it,

00:21:10.950 --> 00:21:12.450
stretch further.

00:21:17.420 --> 00:21:19.630
If you still can't reach it...

00:21:23.670 --> 00:21:24.170
<i>My hand!</i>

00:21:48.780 --> 00:21:50.780
Lieutenant, was that...

00:21:54.120 --> 00:21:55.830
The Void Maker.

00:21:55.830 --> 00:21:57.000
The triggerless tattoo.

00:21:57.170 --> 00:21:58.250
But...

00:21:58.250 --> 00:21:59.210
That can't be...

00:22:02.130 --> 00:22:05.720
I never thought we'd find its match here...

00:23:41.560 --> 00:23:43.270
I'll get right to the point.

00:23:43.270 --> 00:23:45.480
I want you to join us.

00:23:45.730 --> 00:23:47.480
You're the Sealed of the triggerless tattoo,

00:23:47.480 --> 00:23:49.150
whose match we couldn't find before.

00:23:49.530 --> 00:23:51.150
I'll give you time to think about it.

00:23:51.700 --> 00:23:53.780
Next time: "Surprise Attack."

00:23:51.700 --> 00:23:54.950
Surprise Attack
